# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Allowlist: publish ONLY the study workbooks (+ their figure assets) and the
# repository front matter. Everything else stays local/private, including:
#   - Details.txt (personal notes/contact), .work/ scratch, agent skills,
#   - ALL PDFs: IGNOU course material, assignments, question papers, ID card.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

!/SEM1/
!/SEM2/
!/SEM3/
!/SEM4/

# inside each semester folder: keep only workbook .md files and .assets folders
SEM1/*
!SEM1/*.md
!SEM1/*.html
!SEM1/*.assets/
!SEM1/*.assets/**
SEM2/*
!SEM2/*.md
!SEM2/*.html
!SEM2/*.assets/
!SEM2/*.assets/**
SEM3/*
!SEM3/*.md
!SEM3/*.html
!SEM3/*.assets/
!SEM3/*.assets/**
SEM4/*
!SEM4/*.md
!SEM4/*.html
!SEM4/*.assets/
!SEM4/*.assets/**

# internal working notes — never publish
SEM4/MISSING_MATERIAL.md
